{"ts":"2026-08-04T09:19:57.972Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"ecc9554d11d78abfd35454a3","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"Desired contract: mutation commands emit an idempotent bounded receipt with item id, appended annotation identity or index, author, timestamp, changed count, omission metadata, and an explicit opt-in to restore history. Apply the same response shape to comments, notes, and learnings through shared SDK primitives. Preserve stored history exactly; change only the default mutation projection. Add a realistic long-lived fixture so token-budget gates measure the write path."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-9stazf"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"pm comments write response replays the entire accumulated history, so one append can emit hundreds of comments"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Appending a comment with pm comments <id> <text> returns the full comments collection instead of a bounded mutation receipt or only the appended entry. On the long-lived release-health item pm-7zs0, a single 2026-08-04 evidence append replayed hundreds of historical comments and dominated a 100k-token command batch. The read-side --limit contract does not protect the write response. This is a distinct CLI/SDK output-contract gap from the closed MCP read issue pm-6vfg."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-04T09:19:57.972Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-04T09:19:57.972Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":120},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"comments, notes, and learnings writes return a bounded shared SDK mutation receipt by default.; Explicit full-history opt-in preserves current inspection capability and emits omission receipts otherwise.; A long-lived fixture proves output size is independent of prior annotation count within the declared token budget.; CLI, SDK, MCP, schemas, docs, and completion contracts remain aligned."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-n7rr"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/environment","value":"pm CLI 2026.8.4 on the 2,310-item dogfood repository"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Run pm comments pm-7zs0 with one new evidence string and inspect stdout; the response enumerates the complete historical comments array."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A bounded mutation receipt returns only the appended comment and omission metadata; full history requires explicit opt-in."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"The successful append returns every accumulated comment, making output grow without bound over project lifetime."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/customer_impact","value":"Agents spend context tokens re-reading immutable history on every evidence append, directly opposing token-efficient project context management."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-5t33or","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-08-04T09:19:57.972Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-6vfg","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-04T09:19:57.972Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-gzyt2j","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-04T09:19:57.972Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-n7rr","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-08-04T09:19:57.972Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"0ea437bf1440326198db63693b17c7a3562ea066f9751754539cde145998636e","message":"Create bounded annotation-mutation response issue from 2026-08-04 dogfood evidence"}
{"ts":"2026-08-04T09:20:13.455Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"ecc9554d11d78abfd35454a3","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-04T09:20:13.455Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-04T09:20:13.455Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check 2026-08-04: searched every status for comments mutation output, full accumulated comment history, append response token bloat, bounded latest-comment receipt, and annotation output budgets. Closed pm-6vfg fixed the MCP read path; open pm-5t33or owns universal output ceilings; closed annotation-stack items cover input and deduplication. No active or terminal item owns the CLI and shared-SDK write-response projection that reproduced on pm-7zs0."}]}],"before_hash":"0ea437bf1440326198db63693b17c7a3562ea066f9751754539cde145998636e","after_hash":"303f6f7460bda243ac1303f85daa24876b0855942dc2558082efba90f8d08e0b"}
